---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='日常 · Everyday · wo/men in tech'
  description='杭州线下或线上的日常相聚——Coffee Chat、English Chat 与作品 Lab。三至五人，一场从容的对话。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='page-container'>
    <!-- 头部引导 -->
    <header class='page-header'>
      <span class='section-eyebrow'>WHAT WE DO</span>

      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <h1 class='page-title'>日常</h1>
        <p class='page-lead'>
          三五人，一起坐一会儿。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <h1 class='page-title'>Everyday</h1>
        <p class='page-lead'>
          A few people, sit together a while.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='gold-hairline'></div>
    </header>

    <div class='events-detail-stack'>
      {/* 模块 1: Coffee Chat */}
      <article class='event-detail-card'>
        <div class='card-header-line'>
          <span class='card-index'>01</span>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='card-badge lang-zh'>双周轻聚 · 线上 / 杭州</span>
          <span lang='en' class='card-badge lang-en'>Biweekly · Online / Hangzhou</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class='card-title'>Coffee Chat</h2>
        
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='card-body lang-zh'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            三五个人，一杯咖啡，从容一段。
          </p>
          <p>
            在杭州线下或线上视频室，三五个人，把手里的咖啡喝完。聊聊最近在做的事、阅读里的一点想法、正在推敲的数字器物，或者纯粹听别人讲一段探索的经历。
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>约定 · Principles</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>不评高下</strong>：只讲手里的活，不作职场说教。</li>
              <li><strong>从容听与说</strong>：畅所欲言，或全程安静聆听，都从容。</li>
              <li><strong>不设结论</strong>：让话自己长，不预设终点。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div lang='en' class='card-body lang-en'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            A few people, one coffee, one conversation at its own pace.
          </p>
          <p>
            In Hangzhou offline or via private video link, two or three of us finish our cups. We reflect on work-in-progress, lingering design thoughts, unfinished digital artifacts, or simply listen to someone's winding path.
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>Principles</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>No Lectures</strong>: Only the work at hand—no patronizing, no hierarchy.</li>
              <li><strong>Either Way</strong>: Speak when moved, or listen through.</li>
              <li><strong>No Preset End</strong>: Let the talk grow. No predetermined conclusion.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* 模块 2: English Chat */}
      <article class='event-detail-card'>
        <div class='card-header-line'>
          <span class='card-index'>02</span>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='card-badge lang-zh'>双周线上 · 不定期</span>
          <span lang='en' class='card-badge lang-en'>Biweekly Virtual · 40–60 min</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class='card-title'>English Tech & Design Chat</h2>
        
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='card-body lang-zh'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            用英语聊产品、设计或代码，从容表达。
          </p>
          <p>
            40–60 分钟 Show &amp; Tell：嘉宾用英文讲一个界面细节、一段动效或一段代码架构，40 分钟，随后 Q&amp;A。不讲道理，只讲手里那件。
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>收获 · Takeaways</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>安全语境</strong>：无论口语流利与否，只讲手里那件。</li>
              <li><strong>全球审美视野</strong>：接触海外优秀独立软件、开源美学与小而美产品模式。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div lang='en' class='card-body lang-en'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            Discussing product, interface craft, or code in English, at one's own pace.
          </p>
          <p>
            A 40–60 minute Show & Tell: a guest spends 40 minutes in English on one interface detail, micro-interaction, or code architecture, followed by open Q&A. No lectures—only the work at hand.
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>Takeaways</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>Only the Work</strong>: Irrespective of fluency, only the work at hand is discussed.</li>
              <li><strong>Global Aesthetic Horizon</strong>: Engaging with international independent software, open-source gems, and soulful utility.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* 模块 3: 作品 Lab */}
      <article class='event-detail-card'>
        <div class='card-header-line'>
          <span class='card-index'>03</span>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='card-badge lang-zh'>慢工出细活 · 小组共建</span>
          <span lang='en' class='card-badge lang-en'>Deliberate Craft · Small Cohorts</span>
        </div>
        <h2 lang='zh-CN' class='card-title lang-zh'>作品 Lab · 代表作共建</h2>
        <h2 lang='en' class='card-title lang-en'>Craft Lab · Signature Works</h2>
        
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='card-body lang-zh'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            把存了许久的那个想法，做成立得住的一件。
          </p>
          <p>
            日常工作中大多只负责其中一个环节，很少能完整掌控一件产品从哲学、交互到代码的整体质感。作品 Lab 里，不同视角的女性创造者互借经验——设计师带来克制的审美体系，工程师提供严丝合缝的工程实现，研究者打磨真实的问题与解法。
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>做法 · Standard</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>只做值得的事</strong>：代码到动效，间距与基线都对齐。</li>
              <li><strong>个人署名</strong>：所有合作方案完全归属于创作者本人，可直接作为独立代表作。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div lang='en' class='card-body lang-en'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            Taking that lingering intuition out of your journal and shaping it into an enduring artifact.
          </p>
          <p>
            In day jobs, one often handles only a small part, rarely holding complete stewardship over philosophy, interaction, and system integrity. In Craft Lab, women across PM, IxD, and Engineering lend each other perspective—refining taste, robustness, and genuine utility.
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>Craft Standards</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>Only Work That Counts</strong>: Every interaction frame and line of logic is treated with care.</li>
              <li><strong>Full Authorship</strong>: All shared artifacts remain entirely authored by their creators as personal signature portfolios.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    {/* 底部行动引导 */}
    <section class='next-steps'>
      <div class='next-card'>
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='next-text lang-zh'>
          <h3>想参加最近的一期交流？</h3>
          <p>查看近期的具体排期，或留下你的兴趣。</p>
        </div>
        <div lang='en' class='next-text lang-en'>
          <h3>Wish to join an upcoming circle?</h3>
          <p>Browse the current schedule, or leave a quiet note with your interests.</p>
        </div>
        <a href='/upcoming' class='btn btn--solid'>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>查看近期排期</span>
          <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>View Schedule</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding: var(--spacing-6) 0 var(--spacing-20);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .gold-hairline {
    width: var(--spacing-12);
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .events-detail-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .event-detail-card {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-8) var(--spacing-6);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), background var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .event-detail-card:last-child {
    border-bottom-color: transparent;
  }

  .event-detail-card:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
   
  }

  .card-header-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .card-index {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .card-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .card-body {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
    letter-spacing: 0.015em;
  }

  .card-lead {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .card-insight-box {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-5);
    padding: var(--spacing-4) var(--spacing-5);
    background: var(--color-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
  }

  .insight-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .insight-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .insight-list li {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .insight-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .next-steps {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .next-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-8);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .next-text h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-1);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .next-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .next-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-4);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .page-title {
      font-size: var(--font-size-page-title);
    }

    .event-detail-card {
      padding: var(--spacing-5) var(--spacing-4);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-6);
    }

    .card-header-line {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    }

    .card-insight-box {
      padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);
    }

    .next-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: var(--spacing-5) var(--spacing-4);
      gap: var(--spacing-4);
    }

    .next-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: var(--spacing-3);
    }
  }
</style>
